---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Sell An Inherited or Probate Property In Arkansas | Arkansas Property Buyers"
  description="Need to sell an inherited home or property in probate in Arkansas? Arkansas Property Buyers works with estates and heirs for a fast, hassle-free cash sale with no repairs required."
>

<!-- HEADER -->
<Header />

<!-- INFO BANNER -->
<div class="bg-navy text-white px-5 py-2.5 text-center">
  <p class="font-sub font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">
    Helping Arkansas families navigate inherited property for over 30 years &ndash;
    <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors ml-1 underline underline-offset-2">(501) 504-7109</a>
  </p>
</div>

<!-- MAIN CONTENT: 2-column sticky layout -->
<div class="bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_400px] gap-12 lg:gap-14 items-start">

      <!-- ═══ LEFT COLUMN: all scrollable content ═══ -->
      <div>

        <!-- HERO CONTENT -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-4">Family-Owned &amp; Serving Arkansas for Over 30 Years</p>
          <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase leading-tight text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-4">Helping Arkansas Families Navigate Probate, Inherited Property, and Estate Matters for Over 30 Years</h1>
          <p class="tagline-script mb-5">You don't have to handle this alone.</p>
          <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-lg">We know navigating probate can be a difficult and emotional process. For more than 30 years, our family-owned Arkansas company has helped families simplify inherited property situations. Whether you're an heir, a family member, or a personal representative managing an estate, we're here to help you understand your options and move forward with peace of mind.</p>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sub font-bold text-navy text-xs">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              No repairs or updates required
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sub font-bold text-navy text-xs">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              Hundreds of Arkansas families helped
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-sub font-bold text-navy text-xs">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              Local Arkansas family, not a national company
            </div>
          </div>

          <a href="#lead-form" class="lg:hidden inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-orange hover:bg-gold text-white font-sub font-bold text-sm px-7 py-3.5 rounded transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider w-full sm:w-auto">
            Request a Confidential Consultation &darr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

        <!-- EMPATHY SECTION -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">You Are Not Alone</p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight mb-5">We Understand This Is About More Than Real Estate</h2>
          <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">When a loved one passes, the grief alone is a heavy burden. Then comes the practical reality of managing their estate – including a property that may need attention, decisions that need to be made, and family members who all have their own schedules, opinions, and emotions. It's a lot to carry.</p>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Grieving a loss while managing practical responsibilities</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Unsure where to begin or what the right next step is</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Coordinating decisions across family members</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Maintaining a property that needs attention</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Uncertainty about the legal and real estate process</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg px-4 py-3.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Feeling overwhelmed before the process even begins</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mt-6">These are some of the most common things families tell us when they first reach out. You're not behind. You're not doing it wrong. This is simply a lot to manage, and it helps to have someone experienced in your corner.</p>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

        <!-- HOW WE HELP SECTION -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">Why Arkansas Families Choose Us</p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight mb-5">How We Help Arkansas Families</h2>

          <div class="space-y-3 font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            <p>Every probate situation is different. Some families need to sell quickly. Others need time to coordinate across multiple heirs. Some properties are in great shape; others need significant work. We meet families where they are and help them find a practical path forward.</p>
            <p>If selling the property directly to us is the right solution, we're ready to move. If another path makes more sense for your family, we're glad to help you think through those options as well.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Understand Your Available Options</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We help families evaluate practical real estate solutions based on their specific situation – without pressure to choose any particular path.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Connect With Trusted Professionals</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">When families need guidance beyond real estate – for estate contents, property maintenance, or other estate-related matters – we can connect them with experienced professionals who specialize in these situations.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Purchase the Property As-Is</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">If selling is the right path, we purchase properties in any condition – no repairs, no remodeling, no updates required. The property can be sold exactly as it sits.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Handle Remaining Contents</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Families keep the belongings they want. We help with the rest – including connecting families with resources for items that need to be donated, sold, or cleared from the property.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="border-2 border-orange/30 bg-orange/5 rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Simplify the Entire Process</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Our goal is to remove as much complexity and stress from the property side of the equation as possible – so families can focus on what matters most during a difficult time.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8 p-5 bg-navy rounded-xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <p class="font-sub font-bold text-white text-sm">Not sure where to start? We're here to help you think it through.</p>
            <a href="#lead-form" class="flex-shrink-0 bg-orange hover:bg-gold text-white font-sub font-bold text-xs px-5 py-2.5 rounded transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider">Talk to Our Team &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

        <!-- DISCLAIMER SECTION -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <div class="border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl sm:text-2xl leading-tight mb-3">We're Here to Help, But We're Not Attorneys</h2>
                <div class="space-y-3 font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">
                  <p>Arkansas Property Buyers is a family-owned real estate company – not a law firm. We do not provide legal advice, and we are not a substitute for a qualified estate attorney or probate professional.</p>
                  <p>Probate laws, estate administration, and inheritance matters vary by situation and are best handled with the guidance of a qualified legal professional. If you don't already have an attorney involved in your estate, we're glad to help point you toward trusted resources.</p>
                  <p>Our role is to help families understand their real estate options and simplify the property side of the process. That's what we've been doing for more than 30 years – and it's where we can genuinely help.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

        <!-- COMMON CHALLENGES SECTION -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">Situations We Understand Well</p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight mb-8">Common Situations We Help With</h2>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Out-of-State Heirs</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Managing an Arkansas property from another state is difficult. We make it straightforward – handling the process clearly and efficiently so you don't have to make multiple trips or navigate it from a distance alone.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Homes Needing Repairs</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Properties with deferred maintenance or significant repair needs don't have to be a roadblock. We purchase homes in any condition – so the state of the property is never a barrier to moving forward.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Multiple Heirs</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">When several family members are involved in a decision, communication and coordination become critical. We're experienced working with families where multiple people need to be included in the process.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Vacant Properties</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">An empty home still requires insurance, utilities, maintenance, and security. Every month it sits vacant is another month of carrying costs and uncertainty. We help families resolve these situations efficiently.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 8h14M5 8a2 2 0 110-4h14a2 2 0 110 4M5 8v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V8m-9 4h4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Homes Filled With Belongings</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">A lifetime of possessions doesn't have to stop the process. Families keep what they want. We help connect them with the right resources for the rest – so a full house is never a reason to delay moving forward.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Estate Settlement</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Executors and personal representatives carry real responsibility. We work efficiently and clearly to help move the real estate side of an estate forward – giving you one less major item to manage.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

        <!-- WHY WORK WITH APB -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-3">Why Families Choose Us</p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight mb-8">Why Work With Arkansas Property Buyers</h2>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"/><path d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Family-Owned Arkansas Company</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We're local people helping local families. Not a national investment fund, not an out-of-state buyer – just an Arkansas family with 30 years of experience and genuine roots in this state.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">More Than 30 Years of Experience</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We've helped Arkansas families navigate probate and inherited property situations for three decades. This isn't new territory for us – we've seen a wide range of circumstances and know how to help.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">Hundreds of Families Served</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Over the years, we've helped hundreds of Arkansas families navigate inherited property situations. That experience translates directly into better guidance for the families we work with today.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">No Pressure. Ever.</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We understand families are in a sensitive situation. Our goal is to help you understand your options and make the decision that's right for your family – not to push you toward any particular outcome.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
              <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-navy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-1.5">As-Is Purchases</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">No repairs, no updates, no cleanout required before we can move forward. We purchase properties in any condition so families don't have to invest more time or money into a property they're ready to let go of.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="lift border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-5">
